  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The ESP Screen Vortex Desander is designed specifically for wells where high lifting costs are a result of sand problems.",
   "box": {
    "x": 597,
    "y": 246,
    "w": 600,
    "h": 48
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The OSI Vortex Sand Shield technology, which employs centrifugal force to achieve maximum separation efficiency, can be combined with the OSI Tubing Screen or the OSI Super Perf to achieve two-stage sand separation. This system has been successfully proven in multiple installations worldwide.",
   "box": {
    "x": 597,
    "y": 318,
    "w": 600,
    "h": 96
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "paragraph",
   "text": "The ESP Screen Vortex Desander is installed below an ESP sensor, a mechanical packer, or a shroud without any loss of separation efficiency.",
